\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Pooled reconstruction fidelity over 8,172 windows, each entry the per-window metric averaged over the three axes and then over windows (mean$\pm $std across windows where a dispersion is meaningful). MAE is in m/s\(^2\) and MSE in m\(^2\)/s\(^4\); NMAE, \(\Delta \)-NMAE and Pearson are dimensionless. MSE for the near-original trio is given to five decimals, because RP and GADF agree to four. NRMSE, spectral energy and band-mass errors, and the per-axis breakdown are in the Supplementary Material.}}{18}{}\protected@file@percent }
