\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Controlled local-stability test: NMAE under zero-mean Gaussian pixel noise (standard deviation \(\sigma \), out of 255). Values are mean$\pm $standard deviation across 150 activity-balanced, subject-spread windows after averaging two independent draws per nonzero level. Subject-cluster 95\% intervals are in the Supplementary Material.}}{20}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:robustness}{{3}{20}{}{}{}}
\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Reconstruction NMAE by source over the 150 activity-balanced robustness windows: native float operator mean, and mean$\pm $standard deviation for the clean and perturbed PNG conditions. RP, GASF, and GADF are exact to numerical precision in floating point, so their clean error is entirely 8-bit quantisation; MTF is already lossy before storage.}}{20}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:error_sources}{{4}{20}{}{}{}}
